{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":" populates ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","type":"reference"},{"text":" — and therefore the feature gate,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its ","type":"text"},{"code":"free","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" default. This decorator","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache is bounded by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stops vouching for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", so it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"both","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and any app-side reader that builds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Back the cache with ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyValueStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rather than ","type":"text"},{"code":"UserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"UserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a plist","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"can return "},{"code":"errSecMissingEntitlement","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ −34018 — see "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sandboxing &"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlements (macOS)"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":".)"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Threat-model","level":2,"text":"Threat model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":", the cache defends against casual plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" defend against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must keep working offline indefinitely."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"title":"ResilientPaywallService","externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Wraps a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","type":"reference"},{"text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free.","type":"text"}],"